WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.949 --> 00:00:19.949
War is the universal language

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:29.279
And I know a renegade soldier when I see one. Never occurred to me that one might come from above

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:41.830
Space invasion, big car chase

00:00:44.370 --> 00:00:48.020
Truth be told I was ready to hang it up until I met you today.

00:00:51.629 --> 00:00:55.309
So you're not from around here it's hard to explain

00:01:00.550 --> 00:01:03.459
I keep having these memories. I see flashes.

00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:14.439
I think I had a life here, but I can't tell if it's real

00:01:28.070 --> 00:01:30.560
We have no idea what threats are out there

00:01:32.659 --> 00:01:34.659
We can't do this alone

00:01:35.950 --> 00:01:37.950
We need you

00:01:43.840 --> 00:01:45.840
I'm not what you think I am.

